  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Local Economics and Controlling the Expansion of Surplus Coca Crop through Production and Commercialization of Coffee and Diversification of Crops in the Regions of Los Yungas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Control the expansion of surplus coca crops in the municipalities of La Asunta, Chulumani and Caranavi in Los Yungas de La Paz, through the diversification of forest and agroforestry crops, which contribute to food security and strengthen family and local economies, with an intersectional approach in harmony with the environment&#x25AA; &#xB300;&#xCCB4;&#xC791;&#xBB3C; &#xBCF4;&#xAE09;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xC9C0;&#xC18D;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xD55C; &#xCF54;&#xCE74;&#xC78E; &#xBD88;&#xBC95; &#xC7AC;&#xBC30;&#xC9C0; &#xAC10;&#xCD95;
&#x25AA; &#xCEE4;&#xD53C; &#xC791;&#xBB3C; &#xBCF4;&#xAE09;, &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;&#xAC15;&#xD654;, &#xAC00;&#xACF5;&#xC2DC;&#xC124; &#xAD6C;&#xCD95;, &#xC548;&#xC815;&#xC801;&#xC778; &#xC218;&#xCD9C;&#xC2DC;&#xC7A5; &#xD655;&#xBCF4; &#xB4F1; &#xCEE4;&#xD53C; &#xC0B0;&#xC5C5; &#xAC00;&#xCE58;&#xC0AC;&#xC2AC; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xB97C; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED; &#xB18D;&#xBBFC; &#xC18C;&#xB4DD; &#xC99D;&#xB300;
&#x25AA; &#xD63C;&#xB18D;&#xC784;&#xC5C5; &#xC870;&#xC131;&#xACFC; &#xC2DD;&#xB7C9; &#xC791;&#xBB3C; &#xC7AC;&#xBC30;&#xB97C; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xC2DD;&#xB7C9; &#xC548;&#xBCF4; &#xAC15;&#xD654;
&#x25AA; &#xCEE4;&#xD53C; &#xC0DD;&#xC0B0;&#xC790; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;&#xAC15;&#xD654; &#xBC0F; &#xB9C8;&#xC744; &#xB2E8;&#xC704; &#xCEE4;&#xD53C; &#xC0DD;&#xC0B0;&#xC790; &#xC870;&#xD569; &#xC721;&#xC131;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xC9C0;&#xC18D;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xD55C; &#xCEE4;&#xD53C;&#xC0B0;&#xC5C5; &#xAD6C;&#xCD95;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of crops and agroforestry system with food security and infrastructure, Implementation of horticultural orchards, forest and agroforestry plantation for productive diversification, Implementation of infrastructure for the pre-benefit of coffee, Self-sustainability of the local coffee production organizations, Strengthened local productive organization, Consolidation of markets through strategic alliances, Systematized key actors., Studies and research of coffee production with emphasis on women and young people, Knowledge management and dissemination</narrative>
  </description>
